+- new `docs/macos-release.md`.
+
+In `docs/INSTALL.md`:
+
+1. Change the release-artifact count from six to seven and add an Apple
+   Silicon/Lima row to the existing comparison table.
+2. Promote and expand the existing unnumbered “Apple Silicon macOS (Lima)”
+   note into the seventh numbered artifact section, rather than leaving a
+   duplicate summary elsewhere. Use the same structure and tone as the six
