+   log before upload.
+6. Upload an `iolbox-macos` workflow artifact containing only
+   `iolbox-macos-arm64.tar.gz` and
+   `iolbox-macos-arm64.tar.gz.sha256`.
+7. Add `build-macos` to the draft-release job's `needs` list and add the two
